{"d58e7b18-257e-44a1-b792-35b0115080cb":{"concepts":["Memory persistence","Context management","System diagnostics"],"createdAt":"2026-05-29T13:39:26.599Z","filesModified":["/Users/torel/.claude/projects/-Users-torel-code/memory/user_profile.md","/Users/torel/.claude/projects/-Users-torel-code/memory/MEMORY.md"],"keyDecisions":["Initialized structured memory via MEMORY.md and user_profile.md to establish project context.","Removed persistence files at the end of the session to reset the project state after verification."],"narrative":"The session focused on verifying the agent's memory persistence capabilities by initializing project-specific memory files. After confirming the functionality of storing user profiles and project indices, the system performed a cleanup operation to remove the temporary persistence files. This exercise confirmed that the agent can successfully create, index, and manage state files within the project workspace.","observationCount":6,"project":"code","sessionId":"d58e7b18-257e-44a1-b792-35b0115080cb","title":"Memory Persistence Diagnostic and Cleanup"},"b373fd99-6539-4e8d-b28f-129affedacdd":{"concepts":["Programmatic SEO","Topical Authority","Hub and Spoke Architecture","Next.js ISR","Drizzle ORM"],"createdAt":"2026-06-02T18:36:23.410Z","filesModified":["src/app/sitemap.ts","src/app/guides/[rootHub]/page.tsx","src/lib/db/schema/guides.ts","src/agentmemory.ts","settings.json","/Users/torel/.claude/settings.json"],"keyDecisions":["Removed agentmemory integration and plugin configuration due to high token overhead and low utility.","Validated sitemap and dynamic routing configurations to ensure proper SEO indexability for the multi-tier content hierarchy."],"narrative":"The session focused on diagnosing Google Search Console deindexing issues by analyzing the application's routing, sitemap generation, and database schema for guides. I mapped the hierarchical structure of root hubs, pillars, and articles, and incorporated SEO best practices for topic clusters and internal linking. Additionally, I optimized the development environment by removing the `agentmemory` plugin to reduce excessive token consumption and simplify configuration.","observationCount":34,"project":"topicalhq","sessionId":"b373fd99-6539-4e8d-b28f-129affedacdd","title":"SEO Indexing Diagnostic and Project Optimization"},"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc":{"concepts":["League Standings Aggregation","Data Deduplication","Seasonal Filtering","Responsive Stadium Layout","Astro SSR Integration","Knockout Bracket Inference","Penalty Shootout Normalization","Tournament Stage Mapping","Drizzle ORM Query Aggregation","Sports Data Pipeline"],"createdAt":"2026-06-02T18:21:20.856Z","filesModified":["src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro","src/lib/server/teams.ts","scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts","src/components/react/LeaderboardPill.tsx","src/styles/global.css","src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-raw.ts","src/pages/api/data-assignment/assign-matches.ts","src/components/ligi/KnockoutBracket.astro","src/db/schema/sports.ts"],"keyDecisions":["Migrated Echipe directory to the Ligi structure with 301 redirects.","Implemented dynamic seasonal filtering based on August-July football cycles.","Standardized team identities by deduplicating entries via canonical Livescore IDs.","Adopted a \"primary stage\" heuristic prioritizing \"Regular Season\" for league leader identification.","Implemented dynamic round clustering for knockout brackets using path slugs and date-gap heuristics.","Extended database schema to include 'homePenalties' and 'awayPenalties'.","Unified competition UI logic by collapsing redundant stages in favor of specific phases.","Refactored winner logic to prioritize penalty shootout outcomes in tied knockout matches."],"narrative":"This session involved a major architectural transition from team-centric to league-centric data structures, incorporating a new \"editorial-stadium\" aesthetic and robust server-side aggregation for standings. The scope expanded to include complex tournament formatting, such as dynamic knockout bracket generation and multi-stage league handling. Final optimizations ensured accurate reporting of penalty shootouts and distinct categorization of league winners versus cup trophy holders. This modernization streamlines navigation while improving the platform's ability to handle intricate seasonal and knockout sports data.","observationCount":500,"project":"scoru","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","title":"League Infrastructure Modernization and Tournament Logic Implementation"},"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7":{"concepts":["AI Prediction Orchestration","Virtual Economy (Crystal Duels)","Idempotent Database Migrations","Server-side Cron Orchestration","Asset Mirroring","Accumulator Betting","AI-Driven Odds","Drizzle ORM Relational Queries","Match Status Normalization","Crystal Economy Faucet"],"createdAt":"2026-06-02T17:20:53.967Z","filesModified":["src/lib/server/ai-predict.ts","src/lib/server/duels.ts","src/pages/api/challenges/create.ts","src/components/react/ComprehensiveAIPredictions.tsx","src/db/migrations/0004_logo_local.sql","scripts/cron/tick.sh","src/db/schema/sports.ts","src/db/schema/predictions.ts","src/lib/server/odds.ts","src/lib/server/bets.ts","src/pages/api/bets/place.ts","src/components/react/BetSlipApp.tsx","src/pages/pariuri.astro"],"keyDecisions":["Centralized AI prediction generation into a standardized lib/server/ai-predict.ts module.","Implemented a 1v1 duel system for users to challenge AI predictions, gated by a stake of 10+ crystals.","Adopted a local mirroring strategy for team logos to ensure host-agnostic image serving.","Consolidated fragmented cron jobs into a single HTTP-triggered endpoint for production stability.","Implemented dynamic AI-consensus odds calculation with an 8% house margin.","Adopted a 'liveLabel' field for granular status indicators to replace simple numeric minutes.","Switched from a binary free-bet limit to a 3-bet daily faucet with UTC-based daily tracking.","Integrated bet settlement directly into the existing challenge resolution cron flow for atomic updates."],"narrative":"This session established a comprehensive match prediction and betting ecosystem by integrating AI-driven outcome generation, a gamified 1v1 duel mode, and a multi-market accumulator betting engine. The infrastructure was modernized with a centralized cron orchestrator, a local logo asset mirroring system, and granular match status tracking. The session culminated in a robust economy featuring a virtual 'crystal' currency, gated duels, and a daily free-bet faucet managed through atomic server-side settlement.","observationCount":497,"project":"scoru","sessionId":"945fa316-ea0b-42eb-ad6e-a5b5d9559fb7","title":"AI-Driven Match Prediction and Multi-Market Betting System Implementation"},"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da":{"concepts":["Server-Sent Events (SSE)","Forum Reputation Engine","Drizzle ORM Schema Migration","Optimistic UI Updates","Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)","Markdown Sanitization (DOMPurify)"],"createdAt":"2026-06-02T18:29:58.333Z","filesModified":["src/db/schema/forum.ts","src/db/schema/notifications.ts","src/lib/forum/markdown.ts","src/lib/server/forum.ts","src/services/notifications.ts","src/components/react/forum/MatchThread.tsx","src/components/react/NotifBell.tsx","src/pages/api/forum/react.ts","src/pages/api/jobs/live-matches.ts","src/pages/meciuri/[id].astro"],"keyDecisions":["Adopted an idempotent, lazy-loading thread strategy for match discussions, creating threads only when human engagement is detected.","Selected a hybrid UI approach using React islands for interactive features (ThreadComposer, ReactBar) within a performant Astro SSR environment.","Implemented client-side optimistic UI updates for reactions to ensure responsiveness while synchronizing state via backend API transactions.","Chose a soft-delete pattern for forum posts to maintain thread integrity and auditability."],"narrative":"Implemented a full-featured forum system with hierarchical categories, moderator dashboard, and anti-spam controls, seamlessly integrated with match pages. Added social features including post reactions with a reward system, user reputation leaderboards, and an automated mention-notification system. Enabled real-time interactivity across the platform using Server-Sent Events (SSE) for instant forum updates and notification badge synchronization.","observationCount":261,"project":"scoru","sessionId":"76614519-588b-49c2-a613-dab50b89a4da","title":"Forum Implementation and Community Engagement System"}}␀␀º†␀␀DÞÿÿ